1
00:00:49,842 --> 00:00:51,302
- All right. You ready?
- Okay. Yeah.

2
00:00:52,428 --> 00:00:54,054
- Yep.
- Mom and I are gonna win.

3
00:00:54,138 --> 00:00:56,056
- Not a chance.
- Why am I doing this again?

4
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:58,434
- Fatherly duties.
- Oh, yeah, I remember those.

5
00:00:58,517 --> 00:01:00,561
- Go!
- Go! Go! Come on!

6
00:01:03,647 --> 00:01:05,441
Wait for me.

7
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:07,526
- Getting into the corners.
- Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!

8
00:01:12,865 --> 00:01:13,908
Down the beach.

9
00:01:13,991 --> 00:01:15,201
Yeah. Here we go. Okay, I got it.

10
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:16,285
Okay.

11
00:01:16,368 --> 00:01:18,245
- I got it.
- All right.

12
00:01:18,329 --> 00:01:20,706
Hey! Come on, Denise.

13
00:01:20,790 --> 00:01:22,291
- Okay. All right.
- That's great, man.

14
00:01:22,374 --> 00:01:23,626
- Hey, man.
- Nice.

15
00:01:23,709 --> 00:01:25,461
- You got a great family.
- Ah.

16
00:01:25,544 --> 00:01:26,837
You're a lucky man.

17
00:01:26,921 --> 00:01:28,172
Yes, I am.

18
00:01:29,423 --> 00:01:30,466
- A little bit more.
- Mm-hmm.

19
00:01:30,549 --> 00:01:31,926
- Two--
- Hey, Mom.

20
00:01:32,009 --> 00:01:33,761
Look who wanted to come out and play.

21
