You can't leave Starbuck at home.

24
00:01:40,059 --> 00:01:41,060
He loves the summer block party.

25
00:01:41,143 --> 00:01:42,937
Honey, he loves it too much. All right?

26
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,605
Your dad and I both said
you can't bring him.

27
00:01:44,688 --> 00:01:45,689
No.

28
00:01:45,773 --> 00:01:46,774
Dad said it was okay.

29
00:01:48,984 --> 00:01:49,985
Okay.

30
00:01:50,069 --> 00:01:51,070
Starbuck?

31
00:01:51,153 --> 00:01:52,488
Starbuck, listen to me. Right.

32
00:01:52,571 --> 00:01:54,448
You can stay, but you have to be good.

33
00:01:54,532 --> 00:01:56,367
All right? No biting. No digging holes.

34
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:57,785
And no stealing food.

35
00:01:57,868 --> 00:01:59,537
See? He knows.

36
00:02:05,209 --> 00:02:07,211
So what are you gonna do
after we graduate?

37
00:02:07,294 --> 00:02:09,255
Oh, my mom's gonna help me
get a job at Michigan Bell.

38
00:02:09,338 --> 00:02:10,923
