43
00:02:18,347 --> 00:02:20,349
You've never heard of Carl Sagan's <i>Cosmos</i>?

44
00:02:20,432 --> 00:02:22,476
No, is that like science fiction?

45
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,144
No, he's an astronomer.

46
00:02:24,228 --> 00:02:25,312
Mmm.

47
00:02:25,396 --> 00:02:27,606
Uh, he wrote that human beings
are like butterflies

48
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:30,192
