Katie.

52
00:02:35,531 --> 00:02:37,658
Hey, it's good to see you, babe.

53
00:02:37,741 --> 00:02:38,868
You got here early.

54
00:02:38,951 --> 00:02:40,119
I wanted to spend the day with you.

55
00:02:40,202 --> 00:02:41,495
Aw.

56
00:02:41,579 --> 00:02:42,955
Audrey, look out!

57
00:02:47,126 --> 00:02:48,127
Go!

58
00:02:49,295 --> 00:02:50,754
Good boy. Good boy.

59
00:02:50,838 --> 00:02:51,881
Hey.

60
00:02:51,964 --> 00:02:52,965
Hey.

61
00:02:53,048 --> 00:02:54,633
These are just about ready.

62
00:02:54,717 --> 00:02:57,094
Oh, I'm sorry I can't do
the grilling. I-I gotta go.

63
00:02:57,177 --> 00:02:58,721
Can't-- Why? You said you'd do it.

64
00:02:58,804 --> 00:03:01,056
Yeah. They need me to do some
deliveries this afternoon.

65
00:03:04,268 --> 00:03:06,186
I thought you were quitting the side jobs

66
00:03:06,270 --> 00:03:07,563
