Well, either that or somebody
transplanted it as a joke.

144
00:06:44,404 --> 00:06:46,281
I don't know how funny that is.

145
00:06:48,325 --> 00:06:49,576
Want me to pull it up for you?

146
00:06:50,911 --> 00:06:52,496
Sure, if you don't mind.

147
00:07:02,089 --> 00:07:03,590
Hey, let me get some of that flask, bro.

148
00:07:03,674 --> 00:07:05,342
Just a sip. You're being greedy.

149
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:07,177
Have you told your parents yet?

150
00:07:08,345 --> 00:07:09,930
No.

151
00:07:10,013 --> 00:07:11,640
Aren't you a little bit worried about it?

152
00:07:12,808 --> 00:07:14,143
A little bit.

153
00:07:14,226 --> 00:07:16,812
Maybe they just, like,
won't find out about it.

154
00:07:16,895 --> 00:07:18,188
Of course they will.

155
00:07:18,272 --> 00:07:19,398
Charles Tucker's older brother's

156
00:07:19,481 --> 00:07:20,732
gonna beat the hell out of you.

157
00:07:20,816 --> 00:07:22,234
You broke the kid's arm, Brian.

158
00:07:22,317 --> 00:07:23,485
Of course he's not gonna forget.

159
00:07:24,611 --> 00:07:26,113
- It was an accident.
- Bullshit.

160
00:07:26,196 --> 00:07:28,073
You threw a stick
into the spokes of his tires.

161
00:07:28,157 --> 00:07:29,491
What'd you think would happen?

162
00:07:29,575 --> 00:07:31,451
Thought he'd go flying
off his bike like Superman.

163
00:07:31,535 --> 00:07:32,619
Oh, he did.

164
00:07:32,703 --> 00:07:33,704
Way up into the air.

165
00:07:33,787 --> 00:07:35,622
Yeah, you're lucky he's not dead.

166
00:07:35,706 --> 00:07:38,417
I mean, when his brother sees
you, he's going to kill you.

167
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,252
And I mean kill you.

168
00:07:40,335 --> 00:07:41,336
That's why I got my bow and arrow.

169
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:43,005
What good is that gonna do?

170
00:07:43,088 --> 00:07:44,173
Put an arrow in him.

171
00:07:45,174 --> 00:07:46,508
Hey. Hey.

172
00:07:46,592 --> 00:07:47,676
Take a look.

173
00:07:49,803 --> 00:07:50,804
That's the new girl, right?

174
00:07:50,888 --> 00:07:52,097
Oh, get down.

175
00:07:58,437 --> 00:07:59,438
Yeah.

176
00:07:59,521 --> 00:08:00,856
Should be nice.

177
00:08:01,690 --> 00:08:03,066
Oh, she's pretty.

178
