Heard she goes
to some kinda private school.

179
00:08:07,112 --> 00:08:08,238
She doesn't look rich.

180
00:08:08,322 --> 00:08:10,532
You don't have to be rich
to go to private school.

181
00:08:10,616 --> 00:08:12,618
You just gotta be, like,
Catholic or something.

182
00:08:13,994 --> 00:08:15,662
I'm thinking of becoming Catholic.

183
00:08:15,746 --> 00:08:17,748
Shut up, Fergus. Idiot.

184
00:08:25,297 --> 00:08:26,340
Denise!

185
00:08:27,216 --> 00:08:28,342
Hey, Denise!

186
00:08:28,926 --> 00:08:30,010
Mel, what is it?

187
00:08:30,093 --> 00:08:31,845
Your dog got in my yard again last night.

188
00:08:31,929 --> 00:08:33,096
Oh, I'm sorry.

189
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:34,806
Oh, you're sorry? Okay, well,

190
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:36,433
I woke up hearing the damn thing barking.

191
00:08:36,516 --> 00:08:37,517
He would not shut up.

192
00:08:37,601 --> 00:08:39,061
Do you know I barely slept last night?

193
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:41,939
Brian said there's some raccoons

194
00:08:42,022 --> 00:08:43,815
in the trees back there.
Starbuck must be trying to...

195
00:08:43,899 --> 00:08:45,651
You don't understand. I don't
care why he's doing it.

196
00:08:45,734 --> 00:08:47,277
Okay, he's now dug a hole under my fence.

197
00:08:47,361 --> 00:08:48,779
He has shit all over my yard.

198
00:08:48,862 --> 00:08:49,988
I am just so sick of it.

199
00:08:50,072 --> 00:08:53,909
I-- Well, I'll make sure
that he is on a leash

200
00:08:53,992 --> 00:08:55,577
until we get the hole filled, okay?

201
00:08:56,370 --> 00:08:58,580
Fine. Fine. But you know what?

202
00:08:59,665 --> 00:09:02,125
If that dog comes in my yard
one more time,

203
00:09:02,209 --> 00:09:03,669
I'm gonna shoot it.

204
00:09:06,338 --> 00:09:09,549
Listen, Mel. My husband
is too kind to say this,

205
00:09:09,633 --> 00:09:11,176
but if you so much as point a gun

206
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:12,261
in the direction of my dog,

207
00:09:12,344 --> 00:09:14,012
I'll burn your damn house down.

208
00:09:25,482 --> 00:09:27,234
- See you tomorrow.
- See you later, man.

209
00:09:28,986 --> 00:09:30,112
Hey, Brian.

210
00:09:30,195 --> 00:09:31,196
You help me with this?

211
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,364
Yeah, Dad.

212
00:09:37,077 --> 00:09:38,078
Is everything okay?

213
