{\an8}<i>and go straight to the hillside.</i>

1321
01:31:19,016 --> 01:31:21,101
{\an8}<i>Thank God I did what she asked.</i>

1322
01:31:21,185 --> 01:31:23,312
{\an8}<i>My husband thought she was crazy</i>

1323
01:31:23,395 --> 01:31:24,521
{\an8}<i>calling in the middle of the night,</i>

1324
01:31:24,605 --> 01:31:26,481
{\an8}<i>but there was something about her voice</i>

1325
01:31:26,565 --> 01:31:27,733
{\an8}<i>that made me listen.</i>

1326
01:31:27,816 --> 01:31:30,110
{\an8}<i>I have a lot of respect for Denise Platt.</i>

1327
01:31:30,194 --> 01:31:31,987
{\an8}<i>We didn't always get along,</i>

1328
01:31:32,070 --> 01:31:33,155
{\an8}<i>but hell,</i>

1329
01:31:34,448 --> 01:31:35,991
{\an8}<i>she saved my life.</i>

1330
01:31:36,074 --> 01:31:38,827
<i>To this day, the cause
of the event is unknown,</i>

1331
01:31:38,911 --> 01:31:40,621
<i>though there's increasing speculation</i>

1332
01:31:40,704 --> 01:31:42,664
<i>about naturally occurring wormholes</i>

1333
01:31:42,748 --> 01:31:44,458
<i>with the ability to swap matter</i>

1334
01:31:44,541 --> 01:31:46,418
<i>between the present and the past.</i>

1335
01:31:53,467 --> 01:31:55,344
Mom, dinner's ready
if you want to come eat.

1336
01:31:55,427 --> 01:31:56,803
Dad made barbecue.

1337
01:31:56,887 --> 01:31:58,513
Okay. Be right down.

1338
01:31:58,597 --> 01:31:59,640
Okay.

1339
01:32:23,288 --> 01:32:25,290
Good boy.

1340
01:32:25,374 --> 01:32:26,833
Hey!

1341
01:32:30,462 --> 01:32:32,673
- Hi.
- Oh, hey, hi! How are you?
